{"id":"torrey:justification-before-god","source":"torrey","name":"Justification Before God","slug":"justification-before-god","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Promised in Christ — Isa 45:25; 53:11.","refs":[["Isa",45,25,45,25],["Isa",53,11,53,11]]},{"text":"Is the act of God — Isa 50:8; Ro 8:33.","refs":[["Isa",50,8,50,8],["Rom",8,33,8,33]]},{"text":"Requires perfect obedience. — Le 18:5; Ro 10:5; 2:13; Jas 2:10.","refs":[["Lev",18,5,18,5],["Rom",10,5,10,5],["Rom",2,13,2,13],["Jas",2,10,2,10]]},{"text":"Man cannot attain to. — Job 9:2,3,20; 25:4; Ps 130:3; 143:2; Ro 3:20; 9:31,32.","refs":[["Job",9,2,9,2],["Job",9,3,9,3],["Job",9,20,9,20],["Job",25,4,25,4],["Ps",130,3,130,3],["Ps",143,2,143,2],["Rom",3,20,3,20],["Rom",9,31,9,31],["Rom",9,32,9,32]]},{"text":"Is not of works. — Ac 13:39; Ro 8:3; Ga 2:16; 3:11.","refs":[["Acts",13,39,13,39],["Rom",8,3,8,3],["Gal",2,16,2,16],["Gal",3,11,3,11]]},{"text":"Is not of faith and works united. — Ac 15:1-29; Ro 3:28; 11:6; Ga 2:14-21; 5:4.","refs":[["Acts",15,1,15,29],["Rom",3,28,3,28],["Rom",11,6,11,6],["Gal",2,14,2,21],["Gal",5,4,5,4]]},{"text":"Is by faith alone. — Joh 5:24; Ac 13:39; Ro 3:30; 5:1; Ga 2:16.","refs":[["John",5,24,5,24],["Acts",13,39,13,39],["Rom",3,30,3,30],["Rom",5,1,5,1],["Gal",2,16,2,16]]},{"text":"Is of grace. — Ro 3:24; 4:16; 5:17-21.","refs":[["Rom",3,24,3,24],["Rom",4,16,4,16],["Rom",5,17,5,21]]},{"text":"In the name of Christ. — 1Co 6:11.","refs":[["1Cor",6,11,6,11]]},{"text":"By imputation of Christ’s righteousness. — Isa 61:10; Jer 23:6; Ro 3:22; 5:18; 1Co 1:30; 2Co 5:21.","refs":[["Isa",61,10,61,10],["Jer",23,6,23,6],["Rom",3,22,3,22],["Rom",5,18,5,18],["1Cor",1,30,1,30],["2Cor",5,21,5,21]]},{"text":"By the blood of Christ. — Ro 5:9.","refs":[["Rom",5,9,5,9]]},{"text":"By the resurrection of Christ. — Ro 4:25; 1Co 15:17.","refs":[["Rom",4,25,4,25],["1Cor",15,17,15,17]]},{"text":"Blessedness of. — Ps 32:1,2; Ro 4:6-8.","refs":[["Ps",32,1,32,1],["Ps",32,2,32,2],["Rom",4,6,4,8]]},{"text":"Frees from condemnation. — Isa 50:8,9; 54:17; Ro 8:33,34.","refs":[["Isa",50,8,50,8],["Isa",50,9,50,9],["Isa",54,17,54,17],["Rom",8,33,8,33],["Rom",8,34,8,34]]},{"text":"Entitles to an inheritance. — Tit 3:7.","refs":[["Titus",3,7,3,7]]},{"text":"Ensures glorification. — Ro 8:30.","refs":[["Rom",8,30,8,30]]},{"text":"The wicked shall not attain to — Ex 23:7.","refs":[["Exod",23,7,23,7]]},{"text":"Revealed under the Old Testament age. — Hab 2:4; Ro 1:17.","refs":[["Hab",2,4,2,4],["Rom",1,17,1,17]]},{"text":"Excludes boasting. — Ro 3:27; 4:2; 1Co 1:29,31.","refs":[["Rom",3,27,3,27],["Rom",4,2,4,2],["1Cor",1,29,1,29],["1Cor",1,31,1,31]]},{"text":"Does not make void the law. — Ro 3:30,31; 1Co 9:21.","refs":[["Rom",3,30,3,30],["Rom",3,31,3,31],["1Cor",9,21,9,21]]},{"text":"Typified — Zec 3:4,5.","refs":[["Zech",3,4,3,4],["Zech",3,5,3,5]]},{"text":"Illustrated — Lu 18:14.","refs":[["Luke",18,14,18,14]]},{"text":"Abraham. — Ge 15:6.","refs":[["Gen",15,6,15,6]]},{"text":"Paul. — Php 3:8,9.","refs":[["Phil",3,8,3,8],["Phil",3,9,3,9]]}],"refCount":70}
